&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;margin-bottom:6pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;DNP Imagingcomm Asia Sdn. Bhd.、DNP Imagingcomm Europe B.V.、&lt;br/&gt;DNP Imagingcomm America Corporation&lt;br/&gt;※MK Smart Joint Stock Company&lt;/p&gt;
